Bugfix: Reject empty repository location files

An empty file or value passed via the `--repository-file` option
or `RESTIC_REPOSITORY_FILE` environment variable was treated as
the current directory. Restic now instead reports an error if
the file or variable value is empty or contains only whitespace.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22051
https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/22052
